# .reqqignore — reqQuest Framework validator exclusions (glob per line, "#" for comments).
# Portable across validator implementations — see docs/conventions.md, section 6.
requirements/00-context/**
requirements/metrics/**
requirements/README.md
requirements/**/README.md
# Toolkit version manifest (ADR-TOOLKIT-001 D3) — not a requirement artefact.
# This validator never reaches it (it scans requirements/**/*.md), but the contract targets
# several validator copies, so the exclusion is declared rather than assumed.
.reqq/toolkit.lock
